TILEMAP FILE SPEC (#pragma pack)
TYPE                        BYTES                                                           CONTENTS
char                        0-3                                                             Magic number e.g. TILE
int                         4-7                                                             NumRows
int                         8-11                                                            NumCols
int                         12-15                                                           Tile type filepath offset (20)
int                         16-19                                                           Tile value array offset (8052)
tile_type                   Comprises 201 * STRING_LEN = 201 * 40 = 8040 bytes.             Tile type filepaths
                            12-8051 
tile_value                  Comprises (NumRows * NumCols) * 4 bytes per s32                 enum tile_value
